<title>BRAZIL: Brazil bolsa restarts CVRD auction.</title>
<headline>Brazil bolsa restarts CVRD auction.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Rio de Janeiro bolsa restarted the auction of mining group CVRD after a court lifted the second of two injunctions blocking the sale, an official said.</p>
<p>The official said the auction would start at the last bid of 30.20 reais per share.</p>
<p>((-- Fatima Cristina, Rio newsroom 55-21-5074151))</p>
